A||||13||Tigger||"Look out below!" my email got bombed||||8||
Z||000000||Tigger||12-15-2001||11:53 AM||||Just checked my mail and notice this.<P>ERROR: <FONT COLOR="#ff0000">Your account is over 2560k in size. Access to your account has been temporarily disabled. Please delete messages so your account size will be reduced and you will regain access within 24 hours or sign up for Hotmail Extra Storage.</FONT><P>What the... so I delete the three messages that made it past the filters then look over at my junk mail folder and holy socks I've got 521 junk messages!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><P>Sure enough about 500 emails from the same spammer:<P>Subject: Pay Off All Your Debt at Once!<BR>From: <B>vcim23@epost.de</B><BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR><BR>*********************************************<BR>Consolidate all your debt into ONE, EASY monthly payment!<P>We will help you:<BR>*Eliminate interest charges<BR>*Waive late fee charges<BR>*Improve your credit rating<P>And best of all, lower your monthly payments<BR>by 40%-60% and KEEP MORE CASH IN YOUR POCKET!<P>Take just 1 minute to complete our Credit Card Consolidation Form and one of our experienced professional consultants will contact you!<P><B>Yeah, I will, when monkeys fly out of my butt.</B><BR> <A HREF="http://www.d-e-b-t.biz" TARGET=_blank>http://www.d-e-b-t.biz</A> <P>There is no obligation and our service is fast and free!<BR>All information is kept strictly confidential.<P>*********************************************<BR>Since you have received this message you have either responded to<BR>one of our offers in the past or your address has been registered with us.  If<BR>you wish to be removed please reply:<BR>mailto:aspirin4563@yahoo.com?subject=remove<BR>*********************************************<BR><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>I like that, like I registered for this crap.  Yea, removed, more like a confirmation my email is an active account.<P>So anyway, now my email is disabled for a day.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>Uhhh...  This means war!  I wanna take them out, how can I bomb them with 1,000,000 emails..  NO NO wait how about one of those 15,000 lb bombs we're dropping on Afghanistan... MUAHAHA!!!<P>No that's not right, must remain calm.<P>What can I do?  What are my options, any way I can report this?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif"><P>Thanks for listening.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tiggerwinter3.gif">           <BR>T-T-F-N, Ta Ta For Now!<BR><A HREF="http://www.envy.nu/fiero/" TARGET=_blank>Tigger's Fiero Page</A>||||reg||8
Z||000001||avengador1||12-15-2001||11:57 AM||||Just block them from your hotmail account. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Tigger||12-15-2001||12:10 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by avengador1:<BR><B>Just block them from your hotmail account.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hehe, I would but I've reached the 250 limit.  I get on the average of about a dozen spams a day.  I have an intricate system of filters which have helped.  Now all I do is flush a Junk Mail folder about twice a month.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
